{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"OESA-2026-2603","published":"2026-06-05T11:11:32Z","modified":"2026-08-18T01:20:03.465061948Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-10118"],"summary":"poppler security update","details":"is a PDF rendering library.\r\n\r\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nA flaw was found in Poppler&apos;s Splash backend. A remote attacker could exploit this vulnerability by crafting a malicious PDF file that, when rendered, triggers an integer overflow in the `tilingPatternFill` function. This overflow leads to an undersized heap memory allocation, allowing a subsequent out-of-bounds write. Successful exploitation could result in arbitrary code execution, information disclosure, or denial of service within the context of the application processing the PDF.(CVE-2026-10118)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"poppler","ecosystem":"openEuler:24.03-LTS-SP3","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/poppler&distro=openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP3"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"23.12.0-14.oe2403sp3"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["poppler-23.12.0-14.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","poppler-cpp-23.12.0-14.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","poppler-cpp-devel-23.12.0-14.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","poppler-debuginfo-23.12.0-14.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","poppler-debugsource-23.12.0-14.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","poppler-devel-23.12.0-14.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","poppler-glib-23.12.0-14.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","poppler-glib-devel-23.12.0-14.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","poppler-qt5-23.12.0-14.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","poppler-qt5-devel-23.12.0-14.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","poppler-qt6-23.12.0-14.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","poppler-qt6-devel-23.12.0-14.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","poppler-utils-23.12.0-14.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm"],"noarch":["poppler-glib-doc-23.12.0-14.oe2403sp3.noarch.rpm","poppler-help-23.12.0-14.oe2403sp3.noarch.rpm"],"src":["poppler-23.12.0-14.oe2403sp3.src.rpm"],"x86_64":["poppler-23.12.0-14.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm","poppler-cpp-23.12.0-14.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm","poppler-cpp-devel-23.12.0-14.oe2403sp3.x86_64.r